Package: spatialatac
Type: Package
Title: Link Spatial RNA Spots to Single-Cell Multiome RNA Cells
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SpatialATAC", "Developers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Builds deterministic one-to-one links between spatial RNA spots
    and the RNA assay of paired single-cell RNA and ATAC multiome data using
    Seurat integration and Harmony. The links form the cross-language contract
    used by the companion Python package to construct spatial ATAC matrices.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    harmony,
    Seurat,
    withr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3

